Worth testing

One specific development that seems worth adding to your experiments is PP-OCRv6.

A paper published in June 2026 describes three model sizes, ranging from 1.5 million to 34.5 million parameters. Its authors report that the smallest model is substantially faster than its predecessor on CPU while maintaining comparable accuracy on their own benchmark. arxiv.org +1

